1) All vacuums created by spells on this list also create a loud noise. The larger the radius the louder the noise. The GM may wish to rule that all within the radius must make a second RR or be deafened for 1 round per 10 failure (RR attack level equals the radius of the vacuum).
2) An elemental creature made of a gas will be cut to 20% activity CLOSED MENTALISM 4.2.1 GAS MANIPULATION
